@startuml
skinparam rectangle {
    BackgroundColor White
    BorderColor Black
}

rectangle "Power Control Register (Offset 029h)" {
    map RegisterLayout {
        D07 => 
        D06 => 
        D05 => 
        D04 => Rsvd
        D03 => SD Bus Voltage
        D02 => Select
        D01 => 
        D00 => SD Bus Power
    }
}

note right of RegisterLayout
  **Bit Fields:**
  
  **D07-D04: Rsvd (Reserved)**
  
  **D03-D01: SD Bus Voltage Select (RW)**
  - 111b = 3.3V (Typ.)
  - 110b = 3.0V (Typ.)
  - 101b = 1.8V (Typ.)
  - 100b-000b = Reserved
  
  **D00: SD Bus Power (RW)**
  - 1 = Power on
  - 0 = Power off
end note

@enduml